      "id": "b007",
      "chapter": "s1",
      "kind": "narration",
      "display": {
        "en": "Have you ever wondered why it is hot in summer and cold in winter? Many people think the Earth gets closer to the Sun in summer. That is not true. The real reason is that the Earth is tilted."
